OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFeeling fresher today with long
OL,6,Fsunny spells and scattered showers.
OL,7,FThese showers may be heavy at times,
OL,8,Fmainly over the hills. Strong, gusty
OL,9,Fwinds initially particularly along
OL,10,Fexposed coasts, these slowly easing
OL,11,Fthrough the day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers becoming lighter and
OL,14,Fmore confined to coastal areas
OL,15,Fovernight. Winds continue to ease,
OL,16,Falthough remaining breezy along the
OL,17,Fnorthwest coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
