OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FPatchy cloud and sunny
OL,6,Fspells with some isolated light
OL,7,Fshowers at times. Feeling pleasant in
OL,8,Fany sunny spells with light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,11,Fsettled end to the week with sunny
OL,12,Fspells and light winds each day, and
OL,13,Fmist or fog patches possible in prone
OL,14,Flocations each night. Cloud building
OL,15,Fby the weekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
